WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.930
bokura nara daijoubu

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.930
Because we’re still doing okay,

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:12.390
mada tsuyoku nareru kara

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:12.390
we can become even stronger!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.900
takaihiroi sora megake

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.900
Aiming for the tall and wide sky,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.450
kinou made no boku wo hanatsu

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.450
I let go of what I was up until yesterday.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.260
miesuita uso mo, taikutsu na

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.260
Those lies that were easily seen through and my tedious day-by-day life;

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.980
hibi mo, zenbu hodoite

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.980
I left them both behind.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.870
atarashii asa ni me wo hosome

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.870
I narrowed my eyes at the new morning

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.280
kyou mo bokutachi wa ikiteku

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.280
Today we shall also venture out
to live our lives again.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.720
sukoshi nami utsu sabishisadatte

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.720
Even the slight loneliness that sometimes comes about,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.460
taisetsu ni omoeteru

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.460
I consider important.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:45.070
itsuka kanjita shinjitsu mo

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:45.070
Even the truth I felt some day…

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:51.440
massugu koko kara asu ni mukatteru

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:51.440
…is urging us to go on into the future.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.490
bokutachi ga mezashita sekai

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.490
The world that we had all aimed for…

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:03.470
donna kakomo kakaeta mama kitto tadoritsuku

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:03.470
We will arrive at it, no matter what our pasts are.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:08.510
fumidashita kewashii michi mo

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:08.510
We continued forward, even if it is a steep path…

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:11.900
bokura nara daijoubu,

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:11.900
…because we’re still doing okay,

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.280
mada tsuyoku nareru kara

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.280
and we can become even stronger!

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:47.000
What should I do?

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:48.830
What should I do?

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:02.820
The Sakurazuki sisters are transferring so suddenly. What the hell?!

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.080
And that bastard, Nozomu.

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:09.080
His attitude was totally different.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.480
I don’t understand at all.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.580
Just what the hell is going on?!

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:16.860
Kosaka-kun!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.070
Are you all right?

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:20.490
Ah, Ichijou sisters…

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:23.000
Thanks for the chocolates!

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.360
Kosaka-kun, did something happen?

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:26.870
You were sort of spacing out back there.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:33.050
Oh yeah! It’s terrible –
the Sakurazuki sisters are transferring!

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:34.770
Transferring?

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.700
Billy sure is greedy when it comes to food.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.030
I wonder what happened to Onii-chan.

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:50.870
He looks really disappointed.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.660
I know, let’s give him some chocolate.

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:55.860
Oh yeah, totally. He’ll feel better if we give him chocolate.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:01.130
The two of you can give him your chocolates later. Please go into the house first.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:02.050
Eh?

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.870
Mama needs to have a little talk with your Onii-chan. Okay?

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:07.870
Okay!

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:32.870
Nozomu-kun.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:40.030
The girls did their very best and poured their hearts into these. This is just cruel.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.450
Yes, I am cruel.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:52.670
Because of me, Kira-chan and Yura-chan are always heartbroken.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:58.190
At this rate, I’m probably going to hurt Kaoruko-chan and Sumireko-chan too.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.490
I see.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.320
These are from those four then.

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:07.360
Why did it turn out like this?

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.620
It isn’t even conceivable, and yet…

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:13.370
I’m just a normal guy without any outstanding qualities.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:17.200
It shouldn’t be possible to be loved by all four girls, but…

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.630
Something must have gone wrong after I came to this town.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:27.130
Miyabi-san, you talked about the Curse of the Twins earlier.

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:28.660
It’s merely a legend.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.840
It’s not! I’m sure it’s true!

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:35.090
It started when those girls fell in love with me.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.540
I’m sure that curse caused everything to happen!

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:41.560
Something inside this must be manipulating our feelings –

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:44.300
making us see each other differently.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.610
That has to be it! Otherwise, this couldn’t have been possible!

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:48.680
Nozomu-kun!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:50.930
I forbid you from saying any more.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.240
What exactly do you mean, a curse?

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:57.150
Blaming everyone else’s feelings on this? Now, that’s rude.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:02.200
To say that about girls who truly fell in love with you, Nozomu-kun… that’s beyond rude.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.910
The Nozomu-kun before me today is a coward.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:08.120
To receive the adoration of the girls around him,

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.010
then to use the curse as an excuse to run away.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.320
I’m not trying to run away.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:25.590
I believe I’m just trying to make sure no one gets hurt.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:29.230
You don’t want to hurt anyone, huh?

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:32.490
You’re so kind, Nozomu-kun.

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:43.030
But that isn’t kindness. In truth, you’re afraid to get yourself hurt, right?

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:46.340
Kaoruko-chan and Sumireko-chan, Kira-chan and Yura-chan…

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:47.790
You just don’t want them to blame you.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:52.240
You put on a kind of facade for everyone, but you’re just trying to take care of yourself.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:53.450
That’s not true!

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:53.870
It is!

00:05:57.550 --> 00:06:01.400
Why do you think this Legend of the Twins was created?

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.320
It certainly wasn’t a curse.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:09.560
Just one occurrence of this tragedy is more than enough.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.730
The legend was created to warn us so that it never happens again.

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:16.330
They wanted to pass this message on to future generations –

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.100
I believe that’s why they made it.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:26.110
You can’t run away! You have to face this crisis head on!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:30.860
These honest feelings you have been given must be answered honestly.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:42.310
Kira-chan and Yura-chan told me they loved me, but I wasn’t confident in myself.

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:46.400
I wasn’t sure what Kira-chan and Yura-chan were trying to do.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:50.410
And I couldn’t help worrying about Kaoruko-chan and Sumireko-chan.

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:53.410
And I don’t know my own feelings.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:59.320
And then Kenmochi-san told me
to decide on my feelings,

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:03.120
and I don’t know
what I should have done.

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:05.400
And now?

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.960
What do you believe you
should do now?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.590
What do you think you can do now, Nozomu-kun?

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.890
Miyabi-san, please take care of these for a while.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.460
I’m heading out.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.850
I’ve been doing nothing but running away…

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:41.440
The Misses will be transferring to their old Jowaku Middle School.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:45.610
They will never have to see you again, Futami-sama.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:49.460
Kenmochi-san said that they were transferring, as if it had been my fault.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:53.110
He believed I was irresponsible and tried to separate us.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.620
Kira-chan and Yura-chan… they seemed to be having so much fun.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.510
I can’t let them transfer because of me!

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:03.710
I have to talk to Kenmochi-san and make him understand somehow.

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:07.000
Ah, it’s the Laughing Onii-chan.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.360
He sure looked serious.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.470
I wonder if he’s going to an audition.

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:18.650
I’m certain that Kenmochi-san decided this on his own.

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:21.990
There’s no way that the Sakurazuki sisters want to transfer.

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:23.650
Isn’t that so? Isn’t that so?

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.330
The two of them love Nozomu-chan.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.070
There’s no way that they’d want to be apart from him.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.760
Oh please, the Sakurazuki sisters, in love with Nozomu?

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.570
Don’t make such weird jokes.

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:39.080
It’s no joke.

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:40.880
We too…

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.080
Today, we confessed to
Nozomu-chan as well.

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:48.090
Confess… Confess… Unfair…

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:48.090
Note: Kosaka is making a pun on the
“koku” (unfair) sound in “kokuhaku” (confess)

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:51.430
Anyway, we have to see the Sakurazuki sisters.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:52.670
And Kenmochi-san.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.440
Nozomu-chan!

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:58.070
Going to the Sakurazuki residence?

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.700
Then we’d better hurry too.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:03.430
Wait for me!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:14.320
The Master’s approval has arrived.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.760
Let us complete the transfer right away.

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:42.060
Kira-chan, we won’t be able to see Nozomu-kun again once we transfer, will we?

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:48.370
Nozomu-kun has the
Ichijou sisters after all.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.620
Someday, he’ll forget about us.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:54.710
Not true! That’s not true at all!

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:57.150
Nozomu-kun isn’t that kind of person.

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:01.450
That’s right. Nozomu-kun would never forget about us.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.350
Kira-sama… Yura-sama…

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:08.170
Futami-sama?!

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:12.800
Nozomu-kun!

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:14.400
Kenmochi-san!

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:15.170
Stop the car!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.760
No, that will not happen.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.290
Please wait!

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.120
Nozomu-kun!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:31.530
Kenmochi-san, I have a request.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:34.290
You said you would see to it that Kira-chan and Yura-chan transfer schools,

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.360
but please reconsider!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.740
Please let them continue to attend Souai Middle School.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:39.920
Nozomu-kun!

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.790
Stop, it’s dangerous!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:45.340
Kenmochi-san, you may be angry with me, and that can’t be helped.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:48.720
I regret what I’ve done so far.

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:51.880
But if there’s something I can do to fix things, I will endure any punishment.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.380
Nozomu-kun…

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:57.880
That’s why I’m begging you. Don’t make Kira-chan and Yura-chan transfer.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:10:59.380
Nozomu-kun.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.840
Nozomu-kun!

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:11.690
Nozomu-kun!

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:13.580
Nozomu-kun!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:15.610
Kenmochi-san!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:18.960
Nozomu-kun!

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:20.470
Nozomu-kun!

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:45.800
Nozomu-kun!

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:51.310
Kenmochi-san! I’m begging you!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.450
Stop the car, Kenmochi-san!

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.060
Nozomu-kun! Please, just stop this.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.200
Kenmochi-san!

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:04.620
Nozomu-kun!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.380
Nozomu-kun!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.180
Futami-sama!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.210
Nozomu-kun!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.210
Are you hurt?

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:24.300
Kenmochi-san, please stop their transfer.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.550
Nozomu-kun…

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.280
I’m begging you!

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.350
Geh, Nozomu!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.350
What happened to you?

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:41.100
Nozomu-chan! Are you all right?

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:42.740
Yes, I’m fine.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.870
More importantly, why are all of you…

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.880
We heard that the Sakurazuki sisters were transferring.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:51.750
And we figured that there had to be
something that we could do.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.920
The Ichijou sisters…

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:57.220
Kenmochi-san, please don’t make them transfer.

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:01.230
I’m sure that the Sakurazuki sisters want to attend Souai Middle School.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.290
Please.

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:07.730
I do not want to see sadness on the Misses’ faces.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:12.810
If they go to Souai Middle School,
they’ll be sad.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.700
That’s cruel, Kenmochi-san.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.810
Yes, too cruel!

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:22.790
Now wanting to see sadness on their faces – that’s just selfish.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.280
What is?

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:30.670
I, Kenmochi, will serve these girls to the utmost, even if I forfeit my life.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.550
Just what about that is selfish?

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:37.600
It is selfish! The Sakurazuki sisters are not your dolls, Kenmochi-san.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:42.890
Yes, human beings don’t always smile and laugh.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:47.380
Sometimes it’s important that they become sad and cry or get angry.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.100
Kenmochi-san, you’re trying
to avoid all that

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:52.950
and keep the Sakurazuki sisters from experiencing it!

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.860
Then it isn’t for the Sakurazuki sisters’ sake, is it?

00:13:56.860 --> 00:14:00.880
It’s just to keep yourself from being sad, isn’t it?

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:05.320
If you don’t want to see it, then you can just close your eyes.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.740
How rude!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.890
I’ll say it even if it is rude!

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.020
Because we’re friends!

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:13.840
Because…

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:14.750
We’re friends?

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:20.890
The Sakurazuki sisters are too kind to tell you this, even if they mean it, Kenmochi-san.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:24.640
That’s why we, as their friends, are telling you on their behalf.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.350
That’s right, Kenmochi-san.

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:31.020
Because they’re our precious friends, we’ll all be sad if they leave.

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.760
Please, stop their transfer.

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:35.220
Please!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:39.620
Uh…

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.710
We’re asking as well.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:47.450
Everyone, what are you doing here?

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.100
Kosaka-kun,

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:53.830
you kept mumbling “the Sakurazukis are transferring” as you walked around.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.840
The Sakurazuki sisters haven’t been to school so long, we’re worried about them.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:01.550
Do you think we’d stay quiet after hearing about their transfer?

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.420
So that’s what it was.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.100
Everyone…

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.880
For our sake…

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.390
Please.

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:09.850
Don’t make them transfer.

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:11.260
Let them stay at Souai Middle School.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.390
I’m begging you!

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.070
We’re begging you!

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:15.890
Please don’t make them transfer.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:19.900
Kenmochi-san!

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:22.660
We’re begging you.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:25.950
By all means, we want to attend Souai Middle School.

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:28.580
It’s always fun there.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:34.920
It has to be at Souai Middle School, with Nozomu-kun and everyone else!

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.160
Please!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.330
Please!

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:40.310
Please!

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:43.210
Uh, well…

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.100
What?

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:04.860
Ahem, it’s been a while, but this is the Master’s list of trials.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:06.540
Father’s…

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.360
Trials?

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:12.110
Trial number one hundred… the final trial.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:15.120
“Make many good friends.”

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:23.060
Even without being told, you have cleared this last trial with flying colors.

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:27.550
So, you mean…

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:33.050
I’ll tell the Master that there’s no need for you to transfer.

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:36.300
All right!

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:47.310
My dear Misses, you’ve really made good friends.

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.870
Thank you for coming, everyone.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.860
We’re happy, so very happy.

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:57.630
What are you saying?

00:16:57.630 --> 00:16:58.870
It’s only natural.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:04.470
Umm, thank you for saying that you’re our friends.

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.350
We’re very happy.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.850
But we are friends, aren’t we?

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:09.290
Yura-chan, Kira-chan.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:12.270
Kaoruko-chan!

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:13.840
Sumireko-chan!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:20.310
Everyone, I have something that I must apologize for.

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:27.070
Nozomu-kun, we can continue this conversation once we’re in high school.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.660
First, all of us have to do our best on our entrance exams.

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:30.670
Yes!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.680
All right! Everyone, let’s do our best on our entrance exams!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.140
YEAH!

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:08.780
Father, a lot has happened, and I was kind of worried.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:12.110
But I guess I’ll stay in this town.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.660
I love this town, after all.

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:17.630
This town where everyone lives, I love it!

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:27.540
Cheers!

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.810
That was good.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:34.980
Everyone got into the
school of their choice.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:38.450
I really did study for all I was worth.

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:43.240
What, even you, Yura-chan?

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:46.500
Nozomu!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:51.570
I still haven’t given up on Kaoruko-chan.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.020
All right!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:59.040
Gonda-san! Are you crying tears of joy?

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:01.540
But it was great, wasn’t it?

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.130
We can go to the same school as the Ichijou sisters.

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:08.380
Please cheer the Ichijou-sans on our behalf as well, Gonda-san.

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:10.230
Very well, it’s a promise.

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.040
Oh, it’s nothing like that.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.340
Futami-sama,

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:21.050
if you commit even the slightest mistake from this point on, I shall have you commit seppuku.

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:21.050
Seppuku: ritual suicide, often performed as a final act of repentance for an irredeemable failure

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:23.430
Eat as much as you like.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:26.320
Good afternoon, Nozomu-san.

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:28.730
We’re helping out as well.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.690
Ui-san, Koi-san!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.610
Thank god.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:39.970
Thank god…

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.670
Onii-san!

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:45.750
Soujyu-chan!

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:46.990
I wanted to see you.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.000
DAH! What the hell?!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:52.550
It’s spring break, so we came to visit you.

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:53.380
Sara-chan.

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.380
Damn it.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:58.310
Everyone, you seem to be rising to the occasion.

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:01.380
Yoohoo! Let us join you.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.950
The Momoi-senseis…

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.620
Onii-chan.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:14.170
No cheating on us!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:23.710
Damn it, Nozomu’s too damn lucky.

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:26.170
Right now, I should also…

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:30.420
I’m just like Nozomu, so I should have had plenty of chances!

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.750
St-to-op i-it Bi-il-lly.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.510
They look like they’re having fun.

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.250
They sure get along well.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.380
WRONG!

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:44.970
I guess we’re rivals from now on.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:49.690
We pledge to fight fair and square, or something like that.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:52.430
We won’t lose, Sumireko-chan, Kaoruko-chan.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:55.960
We won’t lose either,
Yura-chan, Kira-chan.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:01.960
Nozomu-kun has to try harder from now on, since they’re committed.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:06.250
The Ichijous and the Sakurazukis do have good eyes for men.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:09.450
But letting your guard down because you’re in love won’t do.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.590
So like I was saying…

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:11.950
Nozomu-kun!

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:14.080
Please look after us.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:26.940
Okay everyone, here we go.

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:27.900
Yes!

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:29.350
Okay, say “cheese!”

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:34.530
Coming to this town…
meeting everyone…

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:36.370
It sure was a good thing!

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:58.040
dokomademo tsuzuku sora

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:58.040
Oh, the sky that continues no matter where you go…

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:04.050
daisuki na kono machi de

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:04.050
In this town that I love…

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:10.060
takusan no omoide to, hora,

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:10.060
With all our memories, now look!

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:16.060
onaji dake hohoende

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:16.060
We are smiling the same way

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:26.700
itsudemo kimi no tonari ni iyoutoshiteru no wa

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:26.700
To always be trying to be besides you…

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:39.020
mukashi kara no kuse datte omotteru kedo

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:39.020
…is, I believe, a bad habit I’ve had for a long time

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:45.140
“mata ashita” tte te wo furu toki ni wa

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:45.140
When we wave our hands saying “see you tomorrow,”

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:50.930
sukoshi dake samishii kigasuru yo

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:50.930
I realize that I’m feeling a little lonely at that moment

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:57.230
tooku naru kimi no senaka mitsumete

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:57.230
Staring at your back that is getting further away,

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:03.190
nandaka, fushigi na kimochi

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:03.190
For some reason, a mysterious feeling…

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:09.090
kono mune ni hirogatte yuku

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:09.090
…is spreading through this heart of mine
